              <div className="space-y-3">
                <div className="p-3 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20">
                  <h5 className="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-100 mb-2">IDOR Protection</h5>
                  <p className="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                    Every database query validates user ownership. Agents, sessions, and analytics require userId match. Unauthorized access returns 403 Forbidden.
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div className="p-3 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20">
                  <h5 className="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-100 mb-2">Session Management</h5>
                  <p className="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-2">
                    PostgreSQL-backed sessions with connect-pg-simple. Secure httpOnly cookies with SameSite=Lax. SESSION_SECRET environment variable for encryption.
                  </p>
                  <div className="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-300">
                    cookie: {"{ maxAge: 30d, secure: prod, httpOnly: true }"}
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div className="p-3 rounded-xl bg-green-500/10 border border-green-500/20">
                  <h5 className="text-sm font-bold text-green-300 mb-2">CSP Headers (Helmet)</h5>
                  <p className="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                    Content Security Policy whitelists Jupiter Terminal for $VOICE token swaps. Prevents XSS attacks while allowing trusted third-party integrations.
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div className="p-3 rounded-xl bg-orange-500/10 border border-orange-500/20">
                  <h5 className="text-sm font-bold text-orange-300 mb-2">Input Validation</h5>
                  <p className="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                    Zod schemas validate all API inputs. Drizzle-zod auto-generates schemas from database models. Express-validator provides middleware protection.
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div className="p-3 rounded-xl bg-pink-500/10 border border-pink-500/20">
                  <h5 className="text-sm font-bold text-pink-300 mb-2">Rate Limiting</h5>
                  <p className="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                    Express-rate-limit with Redis backing. AI endpoints have aiLimiter middleware (10 requests/minute). Prevents API abuse and DoS attacks.
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div className="p-3 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20">
                  <h5 className="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-100 mb-2">Secret Management</h5>
                  <p className="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                    Environment variables for all API keys (DEEPGRAM_API_KEY, DEEPSEEK_API_KEY, ELEVENLABS_API_KEY). Never exposed to client. Replit Secrets integration.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
